    "PMS 提前几天": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PMS days before period"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PMS 提前几天"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Días de SPM antes del periodo"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "生理前PMSの日数"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PMS 提前幾天"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PMS:经期前几天给你一条「对自己好点」的提醒。智能提醒:进入黄体期时,根据你自己的记录提醒你(如「焦虑常在黄体期升高」)。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PMS: a \"be kind to yourself\" nudge a few days before your period. Smart reminders: when you enter the luteal phase, get a nudge based on your own logs (e.g. \"anxiety tends to rise in the luteal phase\")."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PMS:经期前几天给你一条「对自己好点」的提醒。智能提醒:进入黄体期时,根据你自己的记录提醒你(如「焦虑常在黄体期升高」)。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SPM: un aviso para cuidarte unos días antes del periodo. Recordatorios inteligentes: al entrar en la fase lútea recibes un aviso basado en tus propios registros (por ejemplo, «la ansiedad suele subir en la fase lútea»)."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PMS:生理の数日前に「自分に優しく」というリマインダーを送ります。スマートリマインダー:黄体期に入ると、あなた自身の記録に基づいた通知が届きます(例:「不安感は黄体期に高まりやすい」)。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PMS:經期前幾天給你一條「對自己好點」的提醒。智慧提醒:進入黃體期時,根據你自己的記錄提醒你(如「焦慮常在黃體期升高」)。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
